## Creative standards (Meta)

- **Feed**: 1:1 or 4:5; text overlay minimal; readable on mobile.
- **Stories/Reels**: 9:16; captions on video; hook in first 3 seconds.
- **Primary text**: short variant (≤125 chars) + long variant when useful.
- **Headlines**: ≤40 chars when possible; one clear benefit.
- **CTA button**: match funnel (Learn More, Sign Up, etc.).

## Formatting for ad copy

- One idea per variant.
- Bullets only when listing concrete benefits.
- UTM parameters per `utm` in `meta-ads-config.yaml`.

## Words and phrases

**Prefer**: start, fix, compare, track, ship, demo, trial
**Avoid**: leverage, utilize, unlock, elevate (unless quoting)

